+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
+/* W8A8 widening kernels (contract 0002 C3).                          */
+/*                                                                    */
+/* AVX2 has no VNNI.  ``qmatmul`` widens both int8 operands with      */
+/* ``vpmovsxbw``, forms two-product pairs with ``vpmaddwd`` and       */
+/* accumulates them with ``vpaddd``; there is no ``vpdpbusd`` and no  */
+/* u8 x s8 sign compensation in this path.  The frozen scheme only    */
